1
00:00:01,150 --> 00:00:02,850
D2.

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:06,260
Amy wrote a letter for an Indian rhino.

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:08,975
Read it below.

4
00:00:08,975 --> 00:00:14,780
Dear Humans, I am an Indian rhino.

5
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:17,600
I live in northern India.

6
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:21,060
I eat grass and small plants.

7
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:26,750
I am writing to ask for your help to protect the rhinos in the wild.

8
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:33,060
Many years ago, thousands of us lived in some parts of Asia.

9
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:45,120
We ate special plants near our homes, but they became fewer and fewer when farmers started using them to feed their animals.

10
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:49,000
People also hunted us for our horns.

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,360
As a result, our numbers started to drop.

12
00:00:53,360 --> 00:01:02,960
The governments of India and Nepal made laws to protect us, but you can do more.

13
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:07,740
Please stop using our horns for your own needs.

14
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:12,810
Our horns are important for us to live healthy lives.

15
00:01:12,810 --> 00:01:17,450
Please help us, or there may be none of us left in the future.

16
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:26,060
Thank you for reading my letter, yours sincerely, Laila, an Indian rhino.
